<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/5/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/5/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2005/5/eng@> .
